unty&rsquo;s 4 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 36% of normal, and September to October did too. So far in 2026, March to April was 56% and May to June was 143% on the middle of the grids. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grid 15188 at 54%.</p>"}
